(5, 'contact-us', 'Contact Us', 6, '', '', '', '', '', NULL, '', NULL, '<p><strong>Thank you for contacting National Acts Customer Support.<br />Please complete the form below so we can provide quick and efficient service.</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>PLEASE DO NOT EMAIL US ABOUT MEET AND GREET TIMES! WE WILL REACH OUT TO EVERYONE ONCE THE BAND HAS CONFIRMED THE TIME. </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>For your convenience we have a very extensive FAQ section that can answer most questions.<br /><a title=\"Frequently Asked Questions\" href=\"/faq\"> CLICK HERE</a></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Please note that ALL tickets and VIP Packages are sold on a final sale basis and are nonrefundable unless a show has been canceled. </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>All service fees are nonrefundable for any reason, including a show cancelation. </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>We will not respond to Refund requests outside of a show cancelation.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1),
