(11, 'filter', 'Filter VIP Packages', 7, 'see.jpg', 'thumb_see.jpg', 'see.jpg', NULL, '', NULL, '', NULL, 'The Filter VIP Experience Includes: a Meet and Greet with Filter, Filter Sticker Pack, Filter Cinch Sack, Filter Hat Pin, Photo Op with band ( must bring own camera) and Early entry to venue (when available) gets you first dibs on merch and the best spot/seat in the venue and much more! Click on an event below for more details.<hr />The Filter European VIP Experience Includes: a Meet and Greet with Filter, a Limited Edition VIP Laminate, a t-shirt from the merch table, a Limited Edition VIP Key Chain and Photo Op with band (must bring own camera). Click on an event below for more detail.', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 9),
